AlchemyHelpControls: Use the journal key to open or close it, Esc to return, and arrow keys to select entries.
AlchemyHelpMaterials: Crafting uses Terraria's material sources, including your inventory, open chests, personal storage, Void Bag, and materials provided by mods.
AlchemyHelpProgress: Crafting grants items and Alchemy EXP. Research, level, and EXP are saved with your character. Ashen Facsimile Dust is excluded from alchemy by default.
